 "display_name": "Airspace Defender", "keywords": ["tabletop", "arcade", "retro", "defense", "shooter"], "long_description": "# UNLEASH THE ORDNANCE WITH A PINCH OF YOUR FINGERS\nYour city is under attack! Deploy the command console to manage your defenses and protect your citizens. Thwart enemy attacks with carefully timed retaliatory strikes!\n\n{1209565883674718}\n\n# IMPROVE YOUR REFLEXES & MASTER THE ARSENAL\nIf you survive the immediate onslaught, you'll get a chance to rebuild your city or upgrade your arsenal from a selection of missiles, bombs, drones and lasers. Complete contracts to earn extra score!\n\n{439655972206404}\n\n# COMPETE WITH FRIENDS ON THE LEADERBOARDS\nWith each wave, new threats emerge: faster missiles, helicopters, drunken kamikaze... Will you achieve eternal glory on the leaderboards, or will your city fall under siege?\n\n{908217047621802}\n\n# RETRO ARCADE ACTION MEETS MODERN MIXED REALITY MAYHEM\nWhether you're hanging out in the living room, catching a sunset outside, stuck in the toilet, or anywhere else, you can always quickly jump into the action!\n\n{1416222999731459}\n\n**\"A must-have for Quest\"** - UploadVR \ud83c\udf96\ufe0f\n\n**\"Breathes new life into an old game\"** - MIXED News \ud83c\udf96\ufe0f\n\n**\"Gets your adrenaline pumping\"** - 6DOF Reviews \ud83c\udf96\ufe0f\n\n**\"Greater than my imagination\"** - Bill Carlton, arcade gaming legend \ud83c\udf96\ufe0f\n\n# KEY FEATURES\n- 6 **Training** Maps; 7 **Practice** Maps; 2 **Arcade** Maps with **Leaderboards**\n- 8 Turret types, 5 Enemy types\n- 15 Turret Contracts (i.e. skill challenges/bounties)\n- And more still in development...\n\nJoin the community:\n**notsuspicious.biz/discord**", "short_description": "Airspace Defender is a 3D tabletop arcade game in mixed reality. Manage your city's defenses and thwart enemy attacks with carefully timed retaliatory strikes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.notsuspicious.biz/privacy", 